# | Advantech ADAM-4019+ — 8-Channel Universal Analog Input Module
# | 
# | Source: advantech-adam-4000-modbus.pdf (Appendix G, Module 4)
# | - 8-channel universal analog input (TC/RTD/V/mA), range per type code.
# | - Modbus RTU, FC02/FC03.
# | - FC02 00201-00208 (addr 200-207): Burn-out Signal ch0-7 (0=Normal, 1=Burn-out).
# | - FC03 40001-40008 (addr 0-7): Current Value ch0-7 (s16, raw ±32000 = full scale).
# | - FC03 40201-40208 (addr 200-207): Type Code ch0-7, R/W.
# | - Actual engineering value = raw × (full_scale / 32000); full scale depends on type code.
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, 9600 baud, 8N1.
